":[],"book_tracks":[],"mentions":[],"podcast":[{"kind":"podcast","title":"Single Release (February 22nd, 2000)","body":"Incubus released a single on this date, which contributed to an industry discussion about whether new metal was evolving into a less polarizing genre. At the time, they were classified as a new metal band. \"released as a single on February 22nd, 2000.\"","year":2000,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"The 00's Part 3: The Return of Rock","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7dXtgTkdv9w"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Escaped New Metal Classification","body":"Incubus was initially categorized under the heading of new metal but eventually escaped that classification, a goal many bands fought hard to achieve. \"I'm thinking of Incubus... Most eventually escaped that classification, something that many fought very hard to do.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"The 90s Part 5b: Hip-Hop's Effects Part 2","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5bQz8R0gbXc"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Unexpected Warped Tour Resume Entry","body":"Incubus is mentioned as an artist whose presence on the Warped Tour might surprise some, highlighting the broad range of bands that have played the festival. \"Here are some other artists that you may not have expected to have warped on their resume... Incubus...\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"24 Years of the Warped Tour","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7jfQaUV6Bq4"}]}],"awards":[],"concerts":[{"kind":"concert","title":"Honda Sponsored Tour (2002)","body":"In 2002, Incubus undertook a tour sponsored by Honda. Singer Brandon Boyd explained that this corporate sponsorship, for a band \"hovering right above the underground and right below the mainstream,\" enabled them to offer $35 arena tickets (which was unheard of at the time) and afford their own PA, monitors, and production for a larger, higher-quality show. \"Taking on a corporate sponsor allows a band like us who's not the biggest band in the world but is somewhere sort of hovering right above the underground and right below the mainstream. It gives us the opportunity to do a couple of things that are very important to us.\"","year":2002,"extra":null,"srcs":[]},{"kind":"concert","title":"Vans Warped Tour (multiple times)","body":null,"year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[]}],"xref":[{"kind":"xref","title":"Intricate Geometric and Crop Circle Designs","body":"Brandon Boyd of Incubus possesses a variety of very intricate tattoos, including geometric designs. One specific design on his forearm resembles a crop circle, which he reportedly had done in Cleveland. \"Brendan Boyd of Inkybus has a number of very intricate tattoos. Some are geometric designs. There's one on his forearm that looks like some kind of crop circle that he had done in Cleveland.\"","year":null,"extra":{"from":"Brandon Boyd","from_id":249271597912665,"type":"curiosity"},"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"Rock'n'Roll Tattoos","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jZeMmPekKMQ"}]}],"charts":[{"id":48307067541717,"type":"album","name":"To the Devil a Daughter","list_id":1071602687787,"list":"RYM Top — Scenes & Movements — NWOBHM","src":"musthear","rank":132,"year":1984,"note":null,"yt":"zhg4IYg1qyk","scaruffi":null},{"id":48941615164171,"type":"album","name":"Serpent Temptation","list_id":83793645545548,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Thrash Metal","src":"musthear","rank":163,"year":1988,"note":null,"yt":"Y8dPkfoJbso","scaruffi":null},{"id":27578887796432,"type":"album","name":"Beyond the Unknown","list_id":83793645545548,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Thrash Metal","src":"musthear","rank":113,"year":1990,"note":null,"yt":"pfrdJRXqICE","scaruffi":null},{"id":222771997201676,"type":"album","name":"Fungus Amongus","list_id":221108802372907,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Funk Metal","src":"musthear","rank"